# Terraform Files
# =================

# Terraform state files (contains sensitive information about your infrastructure)
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfstate.backup

# Terraform crash log files
crash.log
crash.*.log

# Terraform variable files (contains sensitive data like subscription IDs, secrets)
*.tfvars
*.tfvars.json

# Terraform plan files (may contain sensitive information)
*.tfplan
*.tfplan.*

# Terraform CLI configuration files
.terraformrc
terraform.rc

# Terraform directories
.terraform/
.terraform.lock.hcl

